# Read by BuildKit for services/platform-api/Dockerfile. The build context is the repository
# root, so patterns are relative to it. Exclude everything, then let in only what the
# Dockerfile copies.
**
!packages/substack-desk/pyproject.toml
!packages/substack-desk/README.md
!packages/substack-desk/src/**
!services/platform-api/pyproject.toml
!services/platform-api/uv.lock
!services/platform-api/src/**
# caches and probes inside the re-included folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.venv
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
services/platform-api/src/platform_api/*/_probe_*.py
